%% Harmless stored-XSS proof of concept (what we actually demonstrate)
sequenceDiagram
    actor Attacker as Samy (owner, manual)
    participant Elgg as Elgg (www.seed-server.com)
    participant Victim as Victim browser (Alice)
    participant JS as demo.js host (127.0.0.1:8000)

    Attacker->>Elgg: Manually save Brief Description =<br/>&lt;script src="http://localhost:8000/demo.js"&gt;
    Note over Elgg: Stored as profile metadata.<br/>output/text.php echoes it RAW (encoding disabled)
    Victim->>Elgg: GET Samy's profile
    Elgg-->>Victim: HTML including the raw script tag
    Victim->>JS: GET /demo.js
    JS-->>Victim: 200 application/javascript (harmless)
    Note over Victim: Script runs in Elgg origin:<br/>shows banner + alert, logs local event.<br/>NO account change, NO token read.
